<title>AUSTRIA: LIBYAN OIL MINISTER EXPECTS OPEC CEILING FREEZE.</title>
<headline>LIBYAN OIL MINISTER EXPECTS OPEC CEILING FREEZE.</headline>
<text>
<p>VIENNA, June 24 (Retuer) - Libyan oil minister Abdullah Salem al-Badri said on Tuesday he expected OPEC ministers to agree on a freeze of their 25.03 million barrels per day oil production ceiling.</p>
<p>&quot;Yes I expect a rollover,&quot; Badri, the current OPEC President, told reporters on arrival for OPEC's summer conference, which is scheduled to start at 1400 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
